    "title": "Garbage Truck 3D",
    "description": "It's time to become the best garbage collector in the world with this garbage truck simulator! Drive your very own garbage truck to collect trash, improve your vehicle with lots useful upgrades and earn as much money as you can.\r\n\r\nUpgrade your truck with vacuums, new claws and even train helpful birds to collect trash for you! As you progress unlock new neighborhoods and collect even more garbage! Hours of fun and plenty to unlock including special bonus levels to earn tonnes of cash and improve your truck even further!",
